# Dataset
This HR Visualization dataset contains employee information used to analyze workforce performance, employee demographics, and company productivity.

The dataset includes:

- Employee ID
- Employee Name
- Department
- Job Role
- Branch / Location
- Hire Date
- Age
- Gender
- Salary
- Performance Score
- Overtime Status
- Leave Balance
- Job Satisfaction
- Attrition Status
- Education Level
- Skill Level
- Contact Information
- Working Hours
- Attendance Percentage

---

# 📊 Dataset Purpose
This dataset is used for:

- Employee performance analysis
- HR decision making
- Salary distribution analysis
- Workforce demographics visualization
- Attrition & retention analysis
- Attendance monitoring
- Department productivity tracking


# Possible Visualizations
Using this dataset, the dashboard can display:

- Employee count by department
- Salary comparison charts
- Attrition rate analysis
- Gender distribution
- Performance trends
- Attendance monitoring
- Overtime analysis
- Hiring trends over time

